  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>New Shadow Style — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You are born with no innate technique, but in order to make up you learn a special secret. A domain for the weak.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st level, you gain the <em>Simple Domain</em> feat with the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You can activate <em>Simple Domain</em> for free a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus each long rest  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can activate Simple Domain as a bonus action  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The area of Simple Domain can be up to 15 feet instead of 10</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
